-22"}, {"review_id": 691287187, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r691287187-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Impressive ", "text": "Very impressive temple to visit. I recommend to book a guide there,  since they can share a lot of information about everything there is to see.\nHighlights for me where meeting the sadhoes, learn about hindu funerals (you see them burning their deaths, very impressive and beautiful ritual), and see a tantra temple.\n\nAlso possible to visit the elderly home beside the temple. ", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "solo", "stay_date": "2019-07-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "CC23F1CAE59222A3B3C501CB70B47CC7", "name": "Ymke", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/gympiee", "username": "gympiee", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/e2/4a/default-avatar-2020-42.jpg", "contribution_count": 28, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 188567, "location_name": "Apeldoorn", "location_name_detailed": "Apeldoorn, The Netherlands"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2019-07-21", "published_at_date": "2019-07-21"}, {"review_id": 691196835, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r691196835-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Most pleasent tour at the evening at Kathmandu", "text": "Visited this place today and really liked. I never had chance to paryicipate in this Aarti Puja at Pashupatinath and glad i did it today. Don’t miss out this while you are in Kathmandu. ", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 2, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "solo", "stay_date": "2019-07-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "2FF692CBCD2C7ED241E3FE4FE6DB3030", "name": "Nabaraj Thapa", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/himalayanplanet", "username": "himalayanplanet", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1c/88/ae/60/caption.jpg", "contribution_count": 177, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 293890, "location_name": "Kathmandu", "location_name_detailed": "Kathmandu, Nepal"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": ["https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/18/65/89/c4/what-a-peaceful-and-pleasant.jpg", "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/18/65/89/c5/what-a-peaceful-and-pleasant.jpg", "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/18/65/89/c6/what-a-peaceful-and-pleasant.jpg", "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/18/65/89/c7/what-a-peaceful-and-pleasant.jpg", "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/18/65/89/c8/what-a-peaceful-and-pleasant.jpg", "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/18/65/8b/b3/photo0jpg.jpg", "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/18/65/8b/b4/photo1jpg.jpg"], "created_at_date": "2019-07-20", "published_at_date": "2019-07-20"}, {"review_id": 690913295, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r690913295-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Yogis killing all the mood", "text": "We took a guide at place so we could understand more of what's going on, maybe not really place for children if you don't want to introduce them to death in early age,for us it was fine. Our toddler daughter was a dream to see \"colorful yogis\" that's the reason we went there, but they are \"money,money,money\" all the time was a really big disappointment, we would give money anyway which we did but went u approach them and wanna take a picture they covering themselves with umbrella or have special guy who doing it until u give them money so then they start to posing for you. If u taking too many pictures ( I took 5) they guys covering camera. And then they end up asking for more money,we paid to all this \"holy man's\" much more then we paid for entrance,as we didn't want to disappoint our kiddo. Too expensive to be \"blessed\".\n Palm readers on the other side was nice men's,there only one guy who speaks English but we choose who spoke only Nepali as he looked more wise and calm,our guide kindly translate for us. We witness one funeral and burning bodies,better take a mask for cover nose and mouth if u not a fan of burn bodies smell, especially for kids recommended. ", "review_tip": null, "rating": 3, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "family", "stay_date": "2019-07-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "E1222F39B9FA9DC609AE4E28D8E2598F", "name": "Nat M", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/natm803", "username": "natm803", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/ef/73/default-avatar-2020-13.jpg", "contribution_count": 27, "hometown": null, "is_verified": false}, "images": ["https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/18/61/c2/3c/mmexport1563547777364.jpg", "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/18/61/c2/3d/mmexport1563547813898.jpg", "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/18/61/c2/3e/mmexport1563547782578.jpg"], "created_at_date": "2019-07-19", "published_at_date": "2019-07-19"}, {"review_id": 690408005, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r690408005-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Impressive", "text": "A holy place for Hindus. Beautiful temples and architecture. The ritual cremation at the river makes the visit very impressive as